---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <BaseHead title="Terms &amp; Conditions — Mindleaf" description="Mindleaf terms and conditions of use." />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Figtree:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style is:global>
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    :root{
      --sage:#6A9E70;
      --sage-light:#EBF2EC;
      --sage-strong:#3E7245;
      --sage-dark:#2D5C35;
      --sage-mid-alpha:rgba(106,158,112,0.12);
      --bg:#F8F9F6;
      --bg-white:#FFFFFF;
      --text:#1A1A18;
      --text-muted:#6B6B68;
      --text-hint:#ABABAB;
      --border:#DCE8DC;
      --dk-bg:#0C0F0C;
      --dk-white:rgba(245,247,244,0.9);
      --dk-muted:rgba(245,247,244,0.38);
      --dk-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;overflow-x:hidden}


    .page-wrap{
      max-width:720px;
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:110px 40px 80px;
    }
    .page-eyebrow{
      font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;
      font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--sage);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;
    }
    .page-title{
      font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif;
      font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,48px);
      line-height:1.15;color:var(--text);
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }
    .page-meta{
      font-size:13px;color:var(--text-hint);
      margin-bottom:52px;
      padding-bottom:32px;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .section{margin-bottom:36px}
    .section-title{
      font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;
      font-size:15px;font-weight:600;
      color:var(--text);
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }
    .section-body{
      font-size:14px;font-weight:300;
      color:var(--text-muted);
      line-height:1.75;
    }
    .section-body p{margin-bottom:10px}
    .section-body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
    .section-body ul{
      margin:8px 0 8px 20px;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;
    }
    .section-body li{
      font-size:14px;font-weight:300;
      color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.6;
    }
    .contact-box{
      background:var(--bg-white);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:12px;
      padding:20px 24px;
      font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);
      margin-top:8px;
    }
    .contact-box a{color:var(--sage-strong);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
    .contact-box a:hover{text-decoration:underline}


    @media(max-width:768px){
      .page-wrap{padding:96px 24px 60px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<Header />

<div class="page-wrap">
  <p class="page-eyebrow">Legal</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
  <p class="page-meta">Last updated: May 2026</p>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>By downloading, installing, or using Mindleaf ("the App"), you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the App.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">2. Description of service</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>Mindleaf is a stress-relief breathing app that provides guided breathing exercises matched to emotional states. The App is available in a free tier and a paid Pro subscription tier.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">3. Account registration</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>You may use the App as a guest without creating an account. To access certain features (history sync, Pro subscription), you must create an account with a valid email address.</p>
      <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activity under your account.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">4. Free and Pro tiers</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>The free tier includes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>All 5 emotional states and breathing exercises</li>
        <li>1-minute sessions</li>
        <li>Default ambient soundscape</li>
        <li>Last 7 days of session history</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The Pro tier (paid subscription) additionally includes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>1, 3, and 5 minute sessions</li>
        <li>3 soundscapes per emotional state</li>
        <li>Unlimited session history</li>
        <li>Weekly Reflect insights</li>
        <li>Cross-device sync</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">5. Subscriptions &amp; billing</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>Pro subscriptions are billed monthly (£4.99/month) or annually (£39/year). All subscriptions include a 7-day free trial.</p>
      <p>Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period. You can manage or cancel your subscription through your device's app store settings.</p>
      <p>Prices may change with reasonable notice. Existing subscribers will be notified before any price change takes effect.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">6. Refunds</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>Refund requests are handled by Apple (App Store) or Google (Play Store) according to their respective refund policies. We do not process refunds directly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">7. Acceptable use</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Reverse-engineer, decompile, or disassemble the App</li>
        <li>Use the App for any unlawful purpose</li>
        <li>Attempt to access other users' data</li>
        <li>Redistribute, sublicense, or resell the App or its content</li>
        <li>Use automated systems to access the App</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">8. Health disclaimer</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>Mindleaf is a wellness tool, not a medical device. The breathing exercises provided are based on established techniques but are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any medical condition.</p>
      <p>If you are experiencing a mental health crisis, please contact a qualified healthcare professional or your local emergency services. The App is not a substitute for professional medical advice.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">9. Intellectual property</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>All content in the App — including animations, soundscapes, text, design, and code — is owned by Mindleaf and protected by copyright and intellectual property laws. You may not copy, modify, or distribute any content from the App without our written permission.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">10. Data and privacy</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>Your use of the App is also governed by our <a href="/privacy" style="color:var(--sage-strong);font-weight:500;">Privacy Policy</a>, which describes how we collect, use, and protect your data. By using the App, you consent to the practices described in the Privacy Policy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">11. Account termination</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>You may delete your account at any time through Settings → Delete account. This permanently removes all your data.</p>
      <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms, with or without notice.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">12. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>Mindleaf is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the App.</p>
      <p>Our total liability to you shall not exceed the amount you paid for the App in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">13. Changes to terms</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. If we make significant changes, we will notify you through the App. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">14. Governing law</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">15. Contact</h2>
    <div class="section-body">
      <p>If you have questions about these terms:</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-box">
      Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@getmindleaf.com">hello@getmindleaf.com</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<Footer />

</body>
</html>